; Project-wide error/result framework. Wrapped (default), so it is referenced as
; Core.fail, Core.return, Core.Syntax.(let*), Core.Error.t, Core.Error.pp — a
; shared library must not leak a global Error/List module into wrapped-false
; consumers (e.g. lib/native). [Pretty] is the repo-local glue layer around
; Fmt for shared printer conventions.

; err_trace's [name] and [public_name] are the same, so the cross-project
; handle below matches the module it exposes, [Err].

(library
 (name core)
 (libraries fmt err_trace))
